    <briefdescription>
<para>Reorganization of distributed global arrays.<linebreak/>
 <emphasis><ref refid="interfacempp__domains__mod_1_1mpp__redistribute" kindref="compound">mpp_redistribute</ref></emphasis> is used to reorganize a distributed array. <emphasis>MPP_TYPE_can</emphasis> be of type <emphasis>integer</emphasis>, <emphasis>complex</emphasis>, or <emphasis>real</emphasis>; of 4-byte or 8-byte kind; of rank up to 5. <linebreak/>
Example usage: call mpp_redistribute( domain_in, field_in, domain_out, field_out ) </para>    </briefdescription>
